{"id":"6995d561bb55c2ab","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-zfc-forcing-separative-poset.md","title":"ZFC Forcing Separative Poset","display":"df-zfc-forcing-separative-poset — ZFC Forcing Separative Poset","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing-separative-poset","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing-separative-poset"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing-separative-poset — ZFC Forcing Separative Poset","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-poset]]","[[58-df-compatible]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing-separative-poset"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing-separative-poset</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing-separative-poset — ZFC Forcing Separative Poset"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"58-df-poset\">58-df-poset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2ad4b32e9e2eb12a\" href=\"?note=2ad4b32e9e2eb12a\" title=\"58-df-compatible\">58-df-compatible</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{P}\\in V\">\\(\\mathbb{P}\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\subseteq\\mathbb P\\times \\mathbb P\">\\(\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\subseteq\\mathbb P\\times \\mathbb P\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"58-df-poset\">58-df-poset</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Compatible}_S(r,q,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\">\\(\\mathrm{Compatible}_S(r,q,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2ad4b32e9e2eb12a\" href=\"?note=2ad4b32e9e2eb12a\" title=\"58-df-compatible\">58-df-compatible</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingSeparativePoset}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingSeparativePoset}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}separative\\text{-}poset} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcingSeparativePoset}_S(\\mathbb{P},\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land \\forall p,q\\in\\mathbb{P}\\;\\Bigl(\\neg(p\\leq_{\\mathbb P}q)\\to \\exists r\\in\\mathbb P\\;(r\\leq_{\\mathbb P}p\\land\\neg\\mathrm{Compatible}_S(r,q,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}))\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}separative\\text{-}poset} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcingSeparativePoset}_S(\\mathbb{P},\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land \\forall p,q\\in\\mathbb{P}\\;\\Bigl(\\neg(p\\leq_{\\mathbb P}q)\\to \\exists r\\in\\mathbb P\\;(r\\leq_{\\mathbb P}p\\land\\neg\\mathrm{Compatible}_S(r,q,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}))\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","le